      '<b>Pattern separation</b> (dentate) vs <b>pattern completion</b> (CA3): the computational trade-off between distinguishing similar events and retrieving from partial cues — measurable in humans with mnemonic-similarity tasks.',
      '<b>Relational inference and imagination:</b> amnesic patients cannot construct novel scenes or imagine the future (Hassabis & Maguire), showing memory is constructive rather than archival.',
