      ['≈ 15 × 10⁶', 'dentate granule cells per side', 'Feeding ~2.5 million CA3 pyramidal cells.'],
      ['4–8 Hz', 'theta rhythm', 'Encoding/retrieval phase organisation; ripples at 80–140 Hz replay sequences during sleep.'],
      ['1971', 'place cells discovered', 'O’Keefe & Dostrovsky; Nobel Prize 2014 with the Mosers for grid cells.']
