      'Moser EI, Kropff E & Moser MB (2008). Place cells, grid cells, and the brain’s spatial representation system. <em>Annu Rev Neurosci</em>.',
      'Gilbertson MW et al. (2002). Smaller hippocampal volume predicts pathologic vulnerability to psychological trauma. <em>Nat Neurosci</em>.'
