      '<b>Action selection</b> by competitive inhibition; <b>procedural/implicit learning</b> (sequence learning, probabilistic classification) independent of hippocampus.',
      '<b>Response vigour and effort allocation:</b> striatal dopamine sets how hard an organism will work per unit reward (Salamone).'
