    anatomy: ['Rostrum, genu, body, isthmus and splenium. Topography is orderly: genu carries prefrontal fibres, body motor and somatosensory, isthmus superior temporal/parietal, splenium occipital and inferior temporal (including the fibres whose section causes alexia without agraphia).'],
