    caution: 'A methodological caution for quantitative work: DTI scalars are exquisitely sensitive to head motion, and motion correlates with age, symptom severity and IQ — so uncorrected motion manufactures group differences. Report framewise displacement, exclude on a pre-set criterion, and include motion as a covariate.',
